            "o2",
            "o3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Official monitoring",
          "value": "The U.S. National Hurricane Center, part of the National Weather Service, issued the storm’s forecasts, public advisories and tropical-cyclone discussions; NOAA Hurricane Hunter aircraft observations were used to assess its intensity.",
